{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 30, :comments ["<b>Of the red, the red.</b> Anything that is exceedingly red is doubled in expression, like אדמדם, ירקרק. And one may say: so is the way of every person to double his speech when he is pressed to ask for something, and this one was exhausted and in a hurry to eat."], :book :genesis, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 25, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:05:56.280082969Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}